examples
| dest     | girth | weight | -> fee  |
| Tokyo    | 55cm  | 1kg    | 820JPY  |
| Okinawa  | 100cm | 3kg    | 2160JPY |
| Hokkaido | 61cm  | 20kg   | 1710JPY |
